      "message": "dm.MWTransclusionModel: Keep a substituted transclusion on insert\n\nThe parser expands a {{subst:...}} transclusion, so the rendering is\nthe expanded template. An import of that rendering replaced the\ntransclusion node, and the magic word was lost. The result changed\nwith the shape of the expansion, which made the behavior look random.\n\nKeep the transclusion node for these transclusions. The rendering goes\nto the store as before, so the node shows the expansion.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Opus 5\nBug: T438140\nChange-Id: I897fb7ad440dd84c32f574ee834e7ef865db79ab\n"
    },
