      "message": "Edit check: make namespaces configurable\n\nCreates a new config value: `extraNamespaces` which is an object keyed\nwith namespace-names (case-insensitive, spaces or underscores). The\nschema is set up to allow the value to be a boolean or config overrides,\nbut the config overrides are not yet actually supported so if they\u0027re\nused they\u0027ll just count as \"true\" for enabling purposes.\n\nThe main namespace cannot be disabled for checks via this mechanism, but\nit would be easy to make this possible if we wanted to later.\n\nBug: T400506\nChange-Id: I314433a3d701de7d3f4dfb9265419e7545b536a9\n"
