      "message": "Update VE core submodule to master (26216c0d7)\n\nNew changes:\nb811a944a tests: fix some platform issues causing failures on macOS\naed9041bc tests: fix clipboard test failures in Firefox and Safari\n62c3befcd tests: do not assert the selection after tab moves the focus\nbc65aa399 ui.CompletionWidget: hide the entire menu on teardown not just the popup\nc77eb8b7f tests: fix ClipboardHandler blank-line normalization for Safari \u003cpre\u003e\n26216c0d7 LinearData getAnnotationRanges: merge contiguous ranges of the same hash\n\nBug: T437749\nBug: T438070\nChange-Id: Ia80b65595b82c6474e4e022b49a2a69a9dbd069e\n"
